"hint":"Canteen: taped under the front ledge of the order counter."},{"place_no":47,"set_no":2,"pieces":["`while hungry: go()` to the building beside the MBA Block.","`order = input('What will you have?')`","The counter, not the kitchen.","`counter.ledge.under()`"],"hint":"The canteen's order counter."},{"place_no":48,"set_no":1,"pieces":["Where hungry students go between classes.","It stands right next to the MBA Block.","Not where food is cooked: where it is eaten, at the tables.","Find the last table and look under it."],"hint":"Canteen seating area: under the last table (never in the kitchen)."},{"place_no":48,"set_no":2,"pieces":["`while hungry: go()` to the building beside the MBA Block.","`sit(); eat(); repeat()`","`tables[-1]`: the last table.","Look under it, never in the kitchen."],"hint":"The canteen's seating area, last table."},{"place_no":49,"set_no":1,"pieces":["Where hungry students go between classes.","It stands right next to the MBA Block.","Not food: the place you fill your bottle.","Check the side of the water station."],"hint":"Canteen: taped on the side of the drinking water station."},{"place_no":49,"set_no":2,"pieces":["`while hungry: go()` to the building beside the MBA Block.","`bottle.fill(H2O)`","Stay hydrated: the water station.","`station.side`: taped there."],"hint":"The canteen's drinking water station, on its side."},{"place_no":50,"set_no":1,"pieces":["Where hungry students go between classes.","It stands right next to the MBA Block.","Before you eat, you wash your hands here.","Feel under the ledge of the basin."],"hint":"Canteen: taped under the ledge of the hand-wash basin."},{"place_no":50,"set_no":2,"pieces":["`while hungry: go()` to the building beside the MBA Block.","`hands.wash(soap=True)` before `eat()`.","The basins, not the water bottles.","`basin.ledge.under()`"],"hint":"The canteen's hand-wash station, under the basin ledge."},{"place_no":51,"set_no":1,"pieces":["A small shop with drinks and chocolates.","It sits next to the big ground where volleyball and cricket are played.","Not the canteen: smaller, and outdoors by the ground.","Look for a poster on its wall."],"hint":"The SVIT Cafe by the main ground: the poster on its wall."},{"place_no":51,"set_no":2,"pieces":["`snack = cafe.buy('chocolate')`","`ground.neighbour`: next to the volleyball and cricket ground.","Small but mighty, like a tiny function that does one job.","`wall.poster`"],"hint":"The small cafe by the main ground."},{"place_no":52,"set_no":1,"pieces":["Green, open and full of benches.","It sits right next to the MBA Block.","Outdoors: no roof over this one.","Look under the bench nearest the MBA Block."],"hint":"The park by the MBA Block: under the bench nearest the block."},{"place_no":52,"set_no":2,"pieces":["`touch_grass()`: yes, literally.","`mba_block.neighbour`: the green one.","`benches.sort(key=distance_to_mba)[0]`","Look under it."],"hint":"The park next to the MBA Block, nearest bench."},{"place_no":53,"set_no":1,"pieces":["A court with two hoops, between the main block and the MBA Block.","Dribble, shoot, score: basketball.","Of the two nets, choose the one closer to the main block.","Check the back of its pole."],"hint":"Basketball court: the net nearest the main block, back of the pole."},{"place_no":53,"set_no":2,"pieces":["`court = between(main_block, mba_block)`","`sport = 'basket' + 'ball'`","`nets.closest_to(main_block)`","`pole.back`"],"hint":"The basketball net on the main block side."},{"place_no":54,"set_no":1,"pieces":["A court with two hoops, between the main block and the MBA Block.","Dribble, shoot, score: basketball.","Of the two nets, choose the one closer to the MBA Block.","Check the back of its pole."],"hint":"Basketball court: the net nearest the MBA Block, back of the pole."},{"place_no":54,"set_no":2,"pieces":["`court = between(main_block, mba_block)`","`sport = 'basket' + 'ball'`","`nets.closest_to(mba_block)`","`pole.back`"],"hint":"The basketball net on the MBA Block side."},{"place_no":55,"set_no":1,"pieces":["The biggest open ground on campus, near the girls' hostel.","Outdoors, where teams play many games.","Kick, run, GOAL: the game with two goal posts.","Check the back of a goal post."],"hint":"Main ground: the back of a football goal post."},{"place_no":55,"set_no":2,"pieces":["`ground = max(open_spaces)`, beside the girls' hostel.","Played with feet, called football by most of the world.","`goal.post.back`","Siuuu: think of the posts, not the players."],"hint":"The football goal post on the main ground."},{"place_no":56,"set_no":1,"pieces":["The biggest open ground on campus, near the girls' hostel.","Outdoors, where teams play many games.","Bump, set, spike: the net strung high between two poles.","Check one of the net's poles."],"hint":"Main ground: on a volleyball net pole."},{"place_no":56,"set_no":2,"pieces":["`ground = max(open_spaces)`, beside the girls' hostel.","`ball.over(net)` with your hands.","Not the goal posts, not the pitch: the high net.","`net.pole`"],"hint":"The volleyball net on the main ground."},{"place_no":57,"set_no":1,"pieces":["The biggest open ground on campus, near the girls' hostel.","Outdoors, where teams play many games.","Twenty-two yards long, with a bowler at one end.","Look under a rock at one end of the pitch."],"hint":"Main ground: under a rock at one end of the cricket pitch."},{"place_no":57,"set_no":2,"pieces":["`ground = max(open_spaces)`, beside the girls' hostel.","`runs += 6`: the game with bat, ball and stumps.","`pitch.ends[0]`","Lift the rock there."],"hint":"The cricket pitch on the main ground, under a rock at one end."},{"place_no":58,"set_no":1,"pieces":["Find where students live, near the big ground.","The girls' one, not the boys'.","Do not go inside: find the security guard's cabin at the gate.","The card is taped on the outside back wall of the cabin."],"hint":"Girls' hostel: outside back wall of the security guard cabin."},{"place_no":58,"set_no":2,"pieces":["`home_away_fro